================================================================================================
NEW SIGNALS SUGGESTED BY THE SCOUT
================================================================================================
  lee_yang_negative_interval_distance: min distance from a root of G_N to [-1,0].
  root_axis_gap_deg: minimum angular clearance from the real axis.
  ear_empty_hit_payload_A: A_t = P(N_base=t and new runner hits an empty sector).
  ear_payload_mean_level: average miss-count level on which the new ear acts.
  ear_payload_parity_bias: even/odd mass split of A_t, the odd-ear analogue.
  root_motion_reconstruction_check: q_full[t] = q_base[t] - A_t + A_{t+1}.
  fugacity_winner_profile: which configuration maximizes G_N(z) along z in [0,3].
